// failure is a failed LMDB call or check; Run returns it as an error.
type failure struct{ err error }

// Run runs workload group (one of run.Groups) with p: one warm-up and
// p.Reps timed repetitions of each of its workloads, in p.Dir (created,
// and removed at the end). Write transactions run on the calling
